This product adapts the role prompts, transport tokens, memory-commit
pipeline, and Phase 1 / Phase 2 lineage protocol of RSIAgent
(https://github.com/AetherLabsAI/RSIAgent), Copyright 2026 RSIAgent
contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  Sibo Zhu, Shicheng Fan, Xinyue Wang, Wenyi Wu, Kun Zhou, Biwei Huang.
  "RSIAgent: Autonomous Exploration for Recursive Self-improvement in New
  Environments." arXiv:2609.15364, 2026.

The harness-independent engine (src/engine, src/memory, src/protocol,
src/roles) and the host modules src/host/git.ts, src/host/checkpoint.ts and
src/host/sealed.ts are adapted from dsh-rsi
(https://github.com/mutsuki14/dsh-rsi), Copyright 2026 dsh-rsi
contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The prompts
were rewritten for pi's turn-based role sessions.

No RSIAgent benchmark, VM, or evaluator code is included.

pi (https://github.com/earendil-works/pi) is MIT-licensed; this package
uses its published npm packages as peer dependencies and does not
redistribute them.
